::PC_U03_L05_Q01::
Question ID: PC_U03_L05_Q01
MLA Standard: MLA.PC.TR.11
Question:
Which statement correctly calculates a trigonometric function value?
{
=A. tan(90 degrees) is undefined.#Correct. Tangent is undefined when cosine is 0.
~B. sec(pi) is 1.#sec(pi) is -1 because cos(pi)=-1.
~C. sin(150 degrees) is -1/2.#sin(150 degrees) is positive 1/2.
~D. csc(pi/2) is undefined.#csc(pi/2) is 1 because sin(pi/2)=1.
}
